## Important features included
- User authentication (simple email + password with JWT)
- Service list (CRUD endpoints)
- Booking endpoints with basic double-booking prevention
- Admin page to view bookings
- Frontend booking form with date/time selection
- Tailwind for styling

---

## Quick start (local)

1. Clone repo
2. `cd beauty-salon-booking`
3. Install root dev scripts: `npm install` (root) — root script delegates to client & server
4. Start dev: `npm run dev` (starts server on :4000 and Vite client on :5173)

